    "body": "## Summary\n- Replace the git-installed cuDNN frontend (`CUDNN_FRONTEND_GIT_REF`, added in #6427) with the PyPI release `nvidia-cudnn-frontend==1.29.1`.\n- `docker/common/fw_pyproject.toml`: bump the pin from 1.29.0 to 1.29.1.\n- `pyproject.toml`: bump the `override-dependencies` pin to `==1.29.1`. It overrides MCore's `[cutedsl]==1.29.0`.\n- `uv.lock`: regenerated with uv 0.7.2 (the CI version) against the pinned Megatron-LM commit. Only the `nvidia-cudnn-frontend` entries changed (version, wheel URLs and hashes, one specifier).\n- `docker/Dockerfile.fw_final`: remove the `CUDNN_FRONTEND_GIT_REF` arg, the `--no-install-package nvidia-cudnn-frontend` special case, and the post-sync git install and check. `uv sync` now installs the wheel directly.\n- `docker/README.md`: remove the build-arg row.\n- `PRESERVE_BASE_RUNTIME=True` behaviour is unchanged.\n\n## Not yet verified\n- Test image build (draft until done).\n\n## Docs and tests\nREADME build-arg table updated. No Python changes, so no unit tests added.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
